    "id": 22793057,
    "hashId": "b05vOa",
    "name": "Island Practice",
    "description": "<p>After applying for a VisDev job at Framestore, who worked on 'How to Train Your Dragon', I thought my portfolio was lacking some cool Island shots. I did make one a year and half ago, but it's starting to get old and I didn't like the details on it. This quick project is a new attempt at making an island shot!</p>\n\n<p>Made in a couple hours excluding rendering.</p>",
