  {
    "id": 21848802,
    "hashId": "4NZBx4",
    "name": "Airplane in the Clouds",
    "description": "<p>I'm working on a big personal project that requires a sequence in the clouds with some military airplanes. Realism is key, and this render is my attempt at making a convincing cloudscape.\n<br />This required a few attempts at properly shading the clouds in Cycles. I was still able to make this render in only a couple of hours - which makes me happy!\n<br />The VDBs are from Samuel Krug's Patreon.</p>",
